several_included.fl:
  given the .cmx of Several, a prefix of 1 static binding:
    camlSeveral = Block 0 ($4, $5, $6, $7)
  before Simplify, after the prefix, with its 4 imports (14 steps): returns
                                                                    [0:
                                                                    <imported 4>;
                                                                    <imported 5>;
                                                                    <imported 6>;
                                                                    <imported 7>]
  after Simplify, after the prefix, with its 4 imports (6 steps): returns
                                                                    [0:
                                                                    <imported 4>;
                                                                    <imported 5>;
                                                                    <imported 6>;
                                                                    <imported 7>]
  the check of kinds: passes before, passes after
  the check of static names: passes before, passes after, each with the prefix in front of it
  calls outside code: 0 before, 0 after
  the same
  calls outside code once those of known code are inlined: 0
  validated with its imports, given the .cmx of 1 of them: the same once normalised and unused static bindings removed, at the head of the term after too
